  "details": "The instance creation needs to have options to avoid all the tags and other stuff.\n\nI don’t need two separate “Live” and “Happening now” on my small menu.\n\nThe small menu was just fine without a huge add on the top, a shop tab, and multiple live now add ons.\n\nPlease give people the option to customize or change how the menu is set up. Or better yet, just simplify it.\n\nPeople love when they are given the opportunity to curate their experience to what they enjoy, limiting them just turns more people away.",
